      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Awesome day, @satyanadella! \n\nWindows sparked a platform shift that created a new industry for NVIDIA. Then we invented programmable shading GPUs for DirectX, which led to CUDA. \n\nThen we partnered to bring GPU supercomputers to Azure, which helped OpenAI train GPT. That collaboration inspired us to reinvent Windows for the age of personal agents.\n\n4 years. Thousands of engineering years between us.\n\nSo proud of what we built together.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "satyanadella",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1221837516816306177/_Ld4un5A_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 05:02:25",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-07T21:02:25.000Z",
        "id": "2107939627898400819",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107936403808227328/img/vxIsklOGhuQuTpW3.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 1461.827,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107936403808227328/img/vxIsklOGhuQuTpW3.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2107936403808227328/vid/avc1/1920x1080/aWgjJKDMRBqQiEUg.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Satya Nadella",
        "text": "Great to partner with NVIDIA as we kick off this next chapter for Windows.\n\nThank you @JensenHuang and @sriramk for joining us today!",
        "url": "https://x.com/satyanadella/status/2107939627898400819",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
