    {
      "id": "2108059756849938808",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-10-08T04:59:46.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 12:59:46",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Ask any car company if their car can drive you through a city.\n\nDozens of them will say yes in the ad.\n\nOne of them means it.\n\nTesla is the only car you can buy today with supervised self-driving that handles the actual trip: city streets, traffic lights, turns, intersections. You supervise. It drives.\n\nEveryone else sells the highway. Super Cruise, BlueCruise, ProPILOT, Highway Assistant — hands-free until the exit, then the wheel is yours again.\n\nMercedes will let you look away. Below about 40 mph. On a few approved freeways. In a couple of states.\n\nThat is not the same product.\n\nDozens of companies. One car that leaves the driveway and gets you there.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "TheCaptainEli",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1997753138426613760/EZDpm91Z_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-07 23:33:57",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-07T15:33:57.000Z",
        "id": "2107856965665780056",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Captain Eli",
        "text": "Ask any car company if their car can drive you through a city.\n\nDozens of them will say yes in the ad.\n\nOne of them means it.\n\nTesla is the only car you can buy today with supervised self-driving that handles the actual trip: city streets, traffic lights, turns, intersections. You supervise. It drives.\n\nEveryone else sells the highway. Super Cruise, BlueCruise, ProPILOT, Highway Assistant — hands-free until the exit, then the wheel is yours again.\n\nMercedes will let you look away. Below about 40 mph. On a few approved freeways. In a couple of states.\n\nThat is not the same product.\n\nDozens of companies. One car that leaves the driveway and gets you there.",
        "url": "https://x.com/TheCaptainEli/status/2107856965665780056",
