      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "🚨 ELON MUSK ON STARLINK IN INDIA\n\nElon said they would love to be operating Starlink in India.\n\nIt has been nearly four years since Starlink applied to launch there, and the company is still waiting.\n\nThe remaining government approvals would let Starlink bring high-speed internet to remote and underserved areas. https://x.com/cb_doge/status/2107884615138767108/video/1",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "AsFoundX",
