      "text": "Starlink’s affordable global internet could help millions by providing access to education and global markets\n\nReliable connectivity could make a huge difference in underserved communities around the world",
      "quote": {
        "author": "XFreeze",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1876785200010539008/2_HFJjq9_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-08 04:20:15",
